                   VALUES ('FOLLOWING_FUNGI_PROJECT', 'The Fungal Trail', 'An anomaly on has revealed the existence of a colony of strange fungi sending a signal... Somewhere. By amplifying it at the source, our scientists believe we could discover the destination of that signal and understand more about this mycelium.', 360, 'society_technology', '[{"event": "anomaly.6770", "name": "Following the Fungi"}, {"event": "anomaly.6780", "name": null}]');
